<title>DENMARK: Danish January new car yr/yr sales rose 9.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish January new car yr/yr sales rose 9.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations</p>
<p>rose 9.8 percent in January 1997 to 10,164 from 9,261 a year</p>
<p>earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Thursday.</p>
<p>				     Jan 1997   Jan 1996</p>
<p>    New car registrations	10,164    9,261</p>
<p>Leading January registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	 1,464</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	 1,364</p>
<p>    Toyota		  1,147</p>
<p>    Peugeot		   859</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-96965</p>
</text>
